## Today

- [[Daily/{today}|Today's note]]
	- Everything from today. Start here most mornings.
- [[Tasks/todo|What is open]]
	- The live list. Things end up here from conversations.

## Active work

```base
filters:
  and:
    - 'type == "project"'
    - file.inFolder("Projects")
properties:
  file.name:
    displayName: Project
  note.status:
    displayName: Status
  note.next_step:
    displayName: Next step
  note.last_touched:
    displayName: Last touched
views:
  - type: table
    name: Active projects
    filters:
      and:
        - 'status == "active"'
    order:
      - file.name
      - status
      - next_step
      - last_touched
    sort:
      - property: last_touched
        direction: DESC
```

## Recently

```base
filters:
  and:
    - 'type == "daily"'
    - file.inFolder("Daily")
properties:
  file.name:
    displayName: Day
views:
  - type: list
    name: Recent days
    limit: 14
    order:
      - file.name
    sort:
      - property: file.name
        direction: DESC
```

