## Everything else

Folders in the sidebar, not links. Open them there when you want them.

- **`_inbox/`**: anything you could not file. Sorting it later is a real task.
- **`Resources/`**: templates, attachments, reference material.
- **`Intelligence/`**: transcripts, exports, research. Raw, not curated.

